# Aizesk Backend - Docker Ignore
# ================================

# Build outputs
**/target/
**/build/
**/*.jar
**/*.war

# IDE files
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/*.iml
**/.project
**/.classpath
**/.settings/

# Git
.git/
.gitignore

# Logs
**/*.log
**/logs/

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Test files
**/test-results/
**/coverage/

# Documentation
*.md
!README.md
docs/

# Docker files (don't include in context)
docker-compose*.yml
Dockerfile*

# Local development files
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/application-local.properties
